  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nature Based Solutions to Climate Change Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is implemented by the World Wide Fund for Nature and supports the scaling up of existing nature-based solutions and trialling new innovative approaches. It aims to demonstrate the sustainability of nature-based solutions for climate livelihood outcomes in the Indo-Pacific. The overarching goal of the investment is that, through the use and promotion of equitable nature-based solutions to climate change, Pacific and Southeast Asian communities are more socially, economically, and ecologically resilient. In addition to the direct benefits to communities, the investment aims to help the Australian international development community build knowledge, capacity and skills in applying effective, nature-based approaches to their work.</narrative>
  </description>
